 ops on general internal medicine research\, education\, and clinical car
 e.\n\nDeadlines\nSpecial symposia submission opens: 2026-07-14\nSpecial 
 symposia submission: 2026-08-04\nScientific abstract submission: 2026-12
 -11\n\nhttps://annualmeeting.sgim.org/
